    "symbol": "ET\u2080 Turc",
    "description": "Turc (1961) method with average temperature, solar radiation and average relative humidity",
    "method_conditions": "if RHmea >= 50: aT = 1;\nelse: aT = 1 + ((50-RHmean)/70)",
